<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" style="font-family: 'Maitree', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size:28px; line-height:30px; color:#0f476b;"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_1"></div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td height="30" style="height:30px;" class="em_h20"><img src="http://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/spacer-basic.gif" width="1" height="1" alt="" border="0" style="display:block;" /></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: 'Chivo', Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:23px; color:#444444;"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_2"> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">お客様各位,</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">*こちらのメールは全てのダッシュボード（お支払い管理画面）ユーザー様に送信させていただいております</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">大変お世話になっております。</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: 
pre-wrap;">この度の新型コロナウイルスの世界的大流行に伴い、学生様への返金手続きを行う必要性が増加していると認識しております。そこで返金手続きを簡潔化し、さらに遅延を最小限に抑えるために、一括返金の手順を添付の動画にてご案内させていただきます。</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><a href="https://dashboard-new.flywire.com/refunds?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="text-decoration: none; color: #48b985;" target="_blank" class="mktNoTrack"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; 
font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">新しいダッシュボード</span></a></span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">でご利用いただける一括返金の機能は、</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">１つのファイルから複数の返金手続きを作成するため、時間とコストを削減出来ます。</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">添付の４５秒間の動画で、一括返金の手順をご確認ください。</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">＊返金を行うには、ユーザーに返金権限が付与されている必要があります。ユーザーの編集権限を持っているユーザーは、他のユーザーに返金権限を付与することができます。</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">返金権限の付与方法は</span><span style="color: #48b985;"><a href="https://help.client.flywire.com/hc/en-us/articles/360010827459-User-Management-Rights-Portal-Permissions?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="text-decoration: none; color: #48b985;" target="_blank" class="mktNoTrack"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: 
baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">こちら</span></a></span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">をご覧ください。</span></span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">返金手続きをより効率よく、迅速に進めるために、下記３点にご注意ください。</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<ol style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">ダッシュボードで作成された返金手続きと、同金額の資金をお振込みください。</span></li> 
<li style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; 
text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">返金資金をお振込みされる際に、個別の返金は返金IDを、一括返金は一括返金ID（バンドルID）を支払名義人の前か通信欄にご記入ください。入力できない場合、振込証明を </span><span style="color: #48b985; font-size: 16px;"><a href="mailto:clientsuccess_jp@flywire.com?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="text-decoration: none; color: #48b985;" target="_blank" class="mktNoTrack"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">clientsuccess_jp@flywire.com</span></a></span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: 
pre-wrap;"> 宛てに送付し、返金IDもしくは一括返金ID （バンドルID）をご連絡ください。</span></span></li> 
<li style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">出来るだけ早くお支払元の口座/アカウントに返金する為には、返金手続きを開始後可能な限り直ぐに、返金資金を銀行振込にて送金してください。</span></li> 
</ol> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">この３点にご注意いただく事で返金手続きをより迅速に行う事が出来ますが、現在の状況を踏まえますと、返金手続き全体に遅延が発生する可能性があります。ご理解賜りますようお願い申し上げます。</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">また、詐欺や資金洗浄のリスクを軽減するためには、Flywire経由で受け取ったお支払いは、全てFlywireを通して返金を行ってください。</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://youtu.be/-vhMeRmfrBE?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" class="mktNoTrack"><img src="http://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/Watch the Video JP.png" alt="Watch the Video JP.png" height="70" width="204" style="display: block; 
margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" /></a></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span></span><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">ご不明な点やご質問等ございましたら、</span><span style="color: #48b985;"><a href="https://help.client.flywire.com?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="text-decoration: none; color: #48b985;" target="_blank" class="mktNoTrack"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">ヘルプセンター</span></a></span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> を参照していただくか、お気軽にリレーションシップマネージャーまでお問合せくださいませ。</span></span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Flywire</span></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
